Subject: [PATCH] feat(settings): port end4-pC's Quick page

Port of pctrade/end4-pC dc2ca2600ee6: modules/ii/settings/pages/QuickConfig.qml
https://github.com/pctrade/end4-pC/tree/dc2ca2600ee6d7852bf0ac91361db8e510f90a74
